{"id":"en_reborn-my-new-groom-is-my-fianc-s-uncle","title":"Reborn: My New Groom Is My Fiancé's Uncle","titleEn":"Reborn: My New Groom Is My Fiancé's Uncle","description":"Betrayed and murdered in her previous life by Liam, her fiancé, and Gemma, her stepsister, who seized her family's wealth, Sloane gets a second chance when she is reborn on the night of her engagement. She immediately cancels the wedding and instead weds Tristan Hawth, Liam's uncle, who is in poor health. As the two join forces, they gradually expose the far-reaching conspiracy orchestrated by Jonathan and Valerie. Once they have assembled proof against those who wronged them, Sloane and Tristan develop genuine feelings for each other, exchange vows in a true ceremony, and begin a fresh chapter as husband and wife.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/reborn-my-new-groom-is-my-fiances-uncle/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/reborn-my-new-groom-is-my-fiances-uncle/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Billionaire","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfc4o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_reborn-my-new-groom-is-my-fianc-s-uncle_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfc4o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-my-new-groom-is-my-fianc-s-uncle_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfc4o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_reborn-my-new-groom-is-my-fianc-s-uncle_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dfc4o/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloa